Pervert.

521
00:27:28,293 --> 00:27:29,180
Not for that!

522
00:27:31,900 --> 00:27:32,920
For the country.

523
00:27:41,120 --> 00:27:45,057
It's not that we don't appreciate it,
but is a king supposed to do that?

524
00:27:45,140 --> 00:27:47,316
The swordsman is right, Your Majesty.

525
00:27:47,500 --> 00:27:49,077
You're this land's sovereign ruler.

526
00:27:49,160 --> 00:27:50,631
You should bow to no one.

527
00:27:51,460 --> 00:27:52,597
Listen, Igaram.

528
00:27:52,680 --> 00:27:55,915
Authority is something that
you wear over your clothes.

529
00:27:56,340 --> 00:28:00,977
But we're in the bath now, and there is
no such thing as a naked king, is there?

530
00:28:01,060 --> 00:28:03,477
I want to thank all of you
from the bottom of my heart,

531
00:28:03,560 --> 00:28:06,089
as both a father and
a native of this land.

532
00:28:06,420 --> 00:28:09,302
Alabasta will forever be
in your dead Straw Hats.

533
00:28:13,940 --> 00:28:15,597
Thank you all very much.

534
00:28:15,680 --> 00:28:18,520
I cannot tell you how
much we appreciate you.

535
00:28:24,820 --> 00:28:26,200
Tonight? Yep.

536
00:28:26,740 --> 00:28:27,740
We have to leave?

537
00:28:28,560 --> 00:28:30,157
The Marines know we're here.

538
00:28:30,240 --> 00:28:31,077
More will be coming.

539
00:28:31,160 --> 00:28:32,197
I agree with Nami.

540
00:28:32,280 --> 00:28:34,340
We need to get out now. Me too.

541
00:28:34,560 --> 00:28:36,537
And not just because
she's got a pretty face.

542
00:28:36,620 --> 00:28:38,037
Do you think we should leave, Luffy?

543
00:28:38,120 --> 00:28:38,950
Yeah.

544
00:28:39,033 --> 00:28:41,437
But only after we've had
some more yummy food.

545
00:28:41,520 --> 00:28:42,873
No, now, you idiot egg.

546
00:28:43,300 --> 00:28:44,829
What should we do, Igaram?

547
00:28:45,000 --> 00:28:47,097
We have to let them know right away.

548
00:28:47,180 --> 00:28:48,474
You're right, I agree.

549
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:52,057
Well, word of what's happened
here has traveled fast.

550
00:28:52,140 --> 00:28:56,840
They've already released new Wanted
posters, and the bounties are quite large.

551
00:28:58,440 --> 00:29:00,960
Roronoa Zoro, 60 million berries.

552
00:29:02,800 --> 00:29:03,760
Monkey D.

553
00:29:03,960 --> 00:29:05,760
Luffy, 100 million berries.

554
00:29:06,300 --> 00:29:07,130
Incredible.

555
00:29:07,280 --> 00:29:08,597
With bounties like that,

556
00:29:08,680 --> 00:29:12,437
Marine Headquarters must have a keen
interest in capturing the Straw Hats.

557
00:29:12,520 --> 00:29:14,837
You're no longer a mere pirate, Luffy.

558
00:29:14,920 --> 00:29:19,220
Not since, you took down one of
the Seven Warlords of the Sea.
